    "text": "<p>Match List – I with List –II.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1bac9a95-2915-4ee5-8526-19c677805677.png\" style=\"width: 759px; height: 324px;\"/></p><p>Choose the correct answer from options given below:</p>",
